<title>USA: CVS files to offer 14.5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>CVS files to offer 14.5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>WOONSOCKET, R.I. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>CVS Corp said Wednesday it intends to file to offer 14.5 million shares of its common stock, plus up to about 1.3 million additional shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>The offering is on behalf of certain stockhlders as part of a registration-rights agreement entered into in connection with its merger with Revco D.S. Inc drug stores on May 29.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
